Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.30,0:00:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.50,0:00:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:33.70,0:00:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下 {\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.40,0:00:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が {\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.80,0:00:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.30,0:01:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.60,0:01:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.70,0:01:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.10,0:01:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.70,0:01:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.10,0:01:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.90,0:01:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.70,0:01:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:56.80,0:02:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 你觸犯了禁忌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:01.10,0:02:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打開了發誓要封閉的心扉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.40,0:02:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已經不能再把這份工作交給你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:09.60,0:02:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我一起回地獄吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:13.10,0:02:17.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後接受罪孽的懲戒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.60,0:02:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:21.40,0:02:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能回地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.60,0:02:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是不能允許的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.80,0:02:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走 回去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.00,0:02:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 還沒結束
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:42.00,0:02:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 我不會讓你去的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:05.70,0:03:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐好像沒事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:08.10,0:03:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她要去哪裏呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.60,0:03:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去復仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.90,0:03:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,復仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:12.20,0:03:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐現在還被強烈的怨念所支配
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.30,0:03:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:20.50,0:03:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像我也要出手了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.10,0:03:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,輪入道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.40,0:03:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是要去嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.80,0:03:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又要從頭開始嗎 愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.10,0:03:44.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}試縫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:52.50,0:03:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼仙太郎沒有救愛呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:56.70,0:03:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因爲…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:58.50,0:04:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一明白的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:01.30,0:04:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你剛纔說過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.20,0:04:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告訴我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:04.60,0:04:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.30,0:04:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:31.90,0:04:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.60,0:04:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸的事就由我來告訴你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:41.60,0:04:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一在哪裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:43.10,0:04:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把阿一還給我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.40,0:04:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.40,0:05:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不會把鶇交給你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.10,0:05:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你這樣的女人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.70,0:05:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我見都不想見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.70,0:05:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想重歸於好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.60,0:05:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背叛過的人還能相信嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:21.30,0:05:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:23.70,0:05:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 原諒我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:26.20,0:05:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.60,0:05:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不僅背叛我 還背叛了鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.60,0:05:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到那個男的那兒去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.60,0:05:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再出現在我們面前了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:39.50,0:05:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:42.30,0:05:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快滾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.10,0:06:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.20,0:06:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.70,0:06:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.90,0:06:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:32.00,0:06:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.20,0:06:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.00,0:06:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是個壞爸爸吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.70,0:06:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是自己的錯卻不承認
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:58.00,0:07:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.10,0:07:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你爸爸能原諒她的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.10,0:07:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你媽媽就不會死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.30,0:07:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能救她了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.00,0:07:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有媽媽你很寂寞吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.50,0:07:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很痛苦吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.90,0:07:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我來幫你把爸爸送下地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:30.30,0:07:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來 請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:35.90,0:07:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 我不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.10,0:07:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後的事 就由你自己抉擇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:02.30,0:08:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四百年
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:04.90,0:08:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐開始工作都過了那麼多年
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.90,0:08:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作爲懲罰 小姐她不得不做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.60,0:08:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懲罰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在地獄受到的懲罰嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.00,0:08:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐一直很努力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:26.50,0:08:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢長的歲月裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:28.20,0:08:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跨越了時代一直注視着人們的怨恨所產生的結局
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:33.70,0:08:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要怨恨這東西還在 想逃也逃不掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:40.10,0:08:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花上無比漫長的時間
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:43.00,0:08:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐一直在洗去罪孽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:46.10,0:08:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忘記自己的怨恨 封閉自己的心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:50.30,0:08:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些被你們父女 一下子解放出來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.40,0:08:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祖先是小姐怨恨的對象
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們也大喫一驚吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.20,0:09:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不幸的緣分啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:03.80,0:09:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是爲什麼告訴我這些
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.30,0:09:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們不是被命令了來看着我的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.90,0:09:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說實話 我們也不知道該怎麼辦好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:11.70,0:09:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我們是沒有能力的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:16.60,0:09:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,年輕人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:19.80,0:09:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 年輕人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.20,0:09:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是隻和小姐說話嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.20,0:09:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像在叫你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放你出去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:31.40,0:09:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作爲交換
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.50,0:09:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交換
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:36.40,0:09:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有件事想讓你做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:50.30,0:09:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:56.40,0:09:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送他下去就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.00,0:10:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把怨恨的對象送進地獄就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:05.90,0:10:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直都在恨他吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:09.70,0:10:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那都是假的 是你編造的虛假的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:13.70,0:10:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是真的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:15.50,0:10:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使你不知道那時候發生了什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.60,0:10:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心裏還是一直在恨你爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.90,0:10:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 我沒那麼想過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.80,0:10:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你認爲媽媽會死是爸爸的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:29.80,0:10:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我沒那麼想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.40,0:10:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:39.20,0:10:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我沒有這麼想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:42.50,0:10:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:44.90,0:10:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼要說那麼過分的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.70,0:10:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 把阿一還給我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.40,0:10:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:05.10,0:11:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好想想吧 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.80,0:11:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:35.50,0:11:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:38.30,0:11:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(674,31)\fad(300,300)}你的心裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:39.30,0:11:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\move(150,31,170,31,0,0)\fad(300,300)}你的心裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:40.70,0:11:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(680,31)\fad(300,300)}還是一直在恨你爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.70,0:11:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,300)}還是一直在恨你爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.30,0:11:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.00,0:11:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼 這次又…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:10.50,0:12:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.60,0:12:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:26.20,0:12:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:27.80,0:12:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:29.20,0:12:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:30.70,0:12:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.50,0:12:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.60,0:12:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:40.60,0:12:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:42.30,0:12:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:51.40,0:12:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看 這是鶇最愛喫的點心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:56.80,0:12:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.70,0:13:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.40,0:13:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,締結契約後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.00,0:13:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:13.10,0:13:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能前往極樂淨土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:15.10,0:13:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂將飽嘗痛楚與苦難
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永遠徘徊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.50,0:13:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.20,0:13:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我 阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:27.20,0:13:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.70,0:13:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 好痛 好痛啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.90,0:13:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:43.20,0:13:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最愛的爸爸奪走了你的媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:49.30,0:13:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很痛苦吧 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:51.40,0:13:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很難受吧 如果撕心裂肺一般
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.50,0:13:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我來幫你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.20,0:13:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你會輕鬆的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:00.20,0:14:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線 敞開你的心扉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.10,0:14:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用再痛苦了 讓我成爲鶇的力量吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:30.50,0:14:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想讓鶇做什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答我 閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:43.00,0:14:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:45.50,0:14:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停手吧 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.80,0:14:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算這樣做…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:53.50,0:14:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住口
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:03.50,0:15:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 快逃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:11.00,0:15:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:13.70,0:15:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽 好可憐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:17.50,0:15:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可憐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:19.00,0:15:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.60,0:15:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 只要這個人原諒她的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:24.80,0:15:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽就不用死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.70,0:15:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽就會在鶇身邊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:30.60,0:15:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不用那麼寂寞了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:33.50,0:15:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別說了 那和你沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:36.90,0:15:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:38.50,0:15:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:50.10,0:15:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.60,0:15:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可憐的媽媽 都是那個人的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:02.40,0:16:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由你來制裁他吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:13.70,0:16:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:17.90,0:16:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:20.40,0:16:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死的是我就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本來是相信她的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.90,0:16:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卻沒有原諒她 一時火起 不知如何是好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:40.70,0:16:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 對不起 是我的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.40,0:16:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽的死都是我的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:48.60,0:16:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原諒我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:50.40,0:16:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在道歉也晚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.90,0:16:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,發生的事情就無法挽回了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:56.60,0:16:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:59.50,0:17:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我太傻了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:01.20,0:17:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,後悔是沒有意義的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:03.40,0:17:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失去的東西已經無法挽回
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.40,0:17:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線 我幫你報仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:12.40,0:17:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,步美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.70,0:17:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愛你 最喜歡你的笑臉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:18.80,0:17:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才努力工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:21.70,0:17:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:23.00,0:17:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲那讓你過得寂寞 渴望關懷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:29.50,0:17:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我卻沒原諒你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:32.40,0:17:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還希望你死了就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:38.10,0:17:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到竟然真發生了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:42.30,0:17:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…沒能幫你承受那份痛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.30,0:18:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我淨給重要的人們添麻煩 傷害他們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:10.40,0:18:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:11.80,0:18:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇很痛苦吧 寂寞吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:15.40,0:18:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來 解開繩線吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:20.30,0:18:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 解吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:27.40,0:18:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜 你亂說什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:31.50,0:18:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:33.70,0:18:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我纔沒有覺得痛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:36.70,0:18:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和阿一在一起可開心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.70,0:18:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜歡阿一了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:41.50,0:18:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以說很開心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:43.80,0:18:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:44.80,0:18:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你剛纔說什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:47.00,0:18:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一不開心嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:49.40,0:18:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起歡笑的時候都是假的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:52.80,0:18:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起喫飯 看電視 買東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:58.30,0:19:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然媽媽不在 偶爾也會寂寞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:01.40,0:19:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲有阿一 爸爸在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:05.10,0:19:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我沒事 不會痛苦的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:10.20,0:19:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸和我在一起時痛苦嗎 不開心嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:15.20,0:19:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:19.70,0:19:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 很開心啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:23.20,0:19:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要和你在一起 我就感覺很幸福了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:29.90,0:19:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.70,0:19:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:32.90,0:19:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎 太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:55.60,0:19:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小愛就是小愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:11.80,0:20:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個我不要了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:19.20,0:20:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是喜歡仙太郎的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:23.80,0:20:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也一直是最喜歡你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:27.70,0:20:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以一直都很後悔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後才造了那座廟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:00.60,0:21:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:01.50,0:21:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原來的七童寺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:16.60,0:21:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:37.10,0:21:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:40.00,0:21:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:43.10,0:21:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:47.40,0:21:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:07.20,0:22:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼把寺給…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:10.10,0:22:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閻魔愛她…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:13.50,0:22:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 沒什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:18.00,0:22:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:23.20,0:22:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:26.10,0:22:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別再讓我孤零零一個人了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:29.30,0:22:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我保證
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:49.00,0:22:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て {\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:55.50,0:23:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て {\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:02.40,0:23:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ {\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ {\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:19.50,0:23:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:23.30,0:23:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:34.30,0:23:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:41.30,0:23:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.00,0:24:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:19.70,0:24:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後的事 就由你自己抉擇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:32.80,0:24:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要結果好就萬事大吉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:36.00,0:24:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷口如果能癒合就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:38.70,0:24:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過一旦醒悟過來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:40.60,0:24:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的傷口還是一樣疼痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:44.90,0:24:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到頭來 還是沒有終結啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:49.20,0:24:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人類真是可悲至極的生物啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:53.50,0:24:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:56.20,0:24:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的傷口 比原來更…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.12,0:25:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\r\c&H242424&\fs27\pos(444,194)\fad(600,0)}待續……
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:04.50,0:25:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(600,600)}地獄少女project/SK Per Wellthink ANIPLEX
